vented monetary cost.", "Final handoff includes outcome, paths/hashes, criteria met/unmet, commands and exits,", "independent review, human decisions where needed, remaining risks, and next exact action.", "", "## Permissions and context limitations", "", "Packets enforce their own allowlist and reject history paths, path escapes and symlinks.", "They are not an OS sandbox for arbitrary tools. `.rgignore` controls default ripgrep only;", "explicit paths, `--no-ignore`, other tools and Git can bypass search exclusions.", "Read [archive isolation](../ARCHIVES.md) before any historical access. The current session", "cannot migrate outside its writable roots or install under protected `.agents/`."], "truncated": false}

